      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I understand correctly, this assembly makes this comparison:\n`apply_from \u003c\u003d midr \u003c fixed_in` where revision has priority over the variant.\nIf we pack both the `midr_el1` value and `RevisionVariant` as `(revision \u003c\u003c 4) | variant` this whole logic can be simplified into two integer comparisons.\nYou can extract `midr_el1` into the described format with something like this:\n```\nubfx    x2, x1, #{VARIANT_SHIFT}, #{VARIANT_LEN}\nbfi     x2, x1, #{VARIANT_LEN}, #{REVISION_LEN}\n```",
      "revId": "d74ff43038923705ec16efe5d6f2dea1fd6bd441",
